  "body": "This gorgeous brick and cedar residence on sought-after Cloverly Crescent is spacious, has been modernised and is a truly exceptional family home. Set on a substantial 979sqm (approx) freehold title the property offers plenty of outdoor area and good off street parking. Well appointed living and dining areas, separate living space, along with a fabulous gourmet kitchen on the ground floor, create a warm and inviting family hub that flows effortlessly to outdoor entertaining, charming lawns and gardens.\r\n\r\nThe home comprises four generous bedrooms plus a study space and two bathrooms (including an ensuite). \r\n\r\nThere is a double garage, separate laundry, plenty of storage and a large loft area above the garage. Zoned for both Westlake Schools and Rangitoto College, this home is just a short stroll to the beach, shops, and cafes. A much-loved and admired family residence, it perfectly balances character, space, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nExpressions of Interest Close | Tuesday 24th November 2026 at 4pm (unless sold prior)",
